coverage

# Desktop packaging
# - `release/` (electron-builder output) is already covered by the `release` rule above.
# - App icons are generated from icons/icon.png by `bun run --cwd apps/desktop build:icons`
#   (electron-builder buildResources). The hand-authored entitlements plist IS tracked.
apps/desktop/build/icon.png
apps/desktop/build/icon.icns
apps/desktop/build/icon.ico
